Branch:      gh/4-clear-filters
Captured:    2026-09-07T13:32:18Z
Command:     bun run test:e2e -- e2e/tests/tickets.spec.ts --reporter=line
Tree state:  0 modification(s) to client/ server/ core/ e2e/ at capture time
             (0 means the code under test was byte-identical to the commit above)

Recaptured on a verified-clean tree. An earlier capture of this same run
overlapped a reviewer's transient mutation probes, so although those probes
touched nothing these five specs exercise, the artifact was not reproducible.

Why the client server is started separately: playwright.config.ts:29 is
  command: "VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001 bun run --cwd client vite --port 5174"
a POSIX inline env assignment that cmd.exe rejects, so the config cannot start
its own client server on Windows. Pre-existing platform defect, unrelated to
GH-4. The client was started from bash on port 5174 and Playwright reused it
via reuseExistingServer.

